# Witness: an approval whose four fields are four different placeholder words

The placeholder list is closed and every word in it has to be exercised, or an unexercised word
can be deleted from the array with the suite green. "Not yet signed" matters most: it is the
exact string the live HUMAN_REVIEW.md carries, so it is the word most likely to appear in a
real false approval.

## 9. Decision

- [x] **APPROVED FOR PREVIEW** within the intended-use scope above.
- [ ] **APPROVED WITH CONDITIONS** listed below.
- [ ] **NOT APPROVED.**
- [ ] **PENDING** - not yet reviewed.

## 11. Human Attestation

- **Name:** None
- **Reviewer alias:** N/A
- **Signature or attributable commit:** Pending
- **Date:** not yet signed
